# Architecture

Place changes in the owning package. Do not reach across packages with ad hoc imports that bypass contracts.

| Path | Role |
|---|---|
| `apps/web` | Next.js control plane (Vercel). RSC by default. |
| `apps/web/lib/gen2` | Gen 2 workspace lifecycle, access, collaboration, and agent runtime. |
| `apps/cli` | CLI only. |
| `packages/db` | Drizzle schema, queries, migrations. |
| `packages/contracts` | Shared validated API contracts. |
| `packages/config` | Config schemas. |
| `packages/shared-types` | Shared TS types. |
| `services/orchestrator` | Rust runtime control. |
| `infra/azure` | Azure Firecracker runtime stack. |
| `infra/runtime` | Cloud-neutral host bootstrap and guest image tooling. |

Validate at service and persistence boundaries (typically Zod). Follow existing modules; do not add a parallel data layer.
